        ("The Blank Stamp in the Forge", "A heavy shape has rolled across the practice yard, leaving a stair short of its first mark. Rowan secures the forge path. Nia asks the armourer to preserve a blank chest stamp and the wheel track as separate evidence, because neither shows who put the machines here."),
