        ("A Cut Beyond the Doorframe", "A blade mark appeared on the far wall behind a locked barracks door. Rowan clears the gallery where the watch heard it, while Elara maps the cuts and the lantern shadows. She will not open the sealed records until the room is safe and two witnesses agree on the time."),
