        ("The Mirror and the Seed Scale", "The old shepherd's mirror fogs in an empty shed, while a black residue appears on the seed scale but not the grain sacks. Drive the remaining visitors from the south lane so Talia can reopen the store. She asks Rowan to keep the mirror and shell dust apart until the crew can repeat both observations."),
